  "id": "black-bean-soup-with-chunky-raita",
  "name": "Black Bean Soup with Chunky Raita",
  "subtitle": "A smoky bean soup finished with cool yogurt, avocado, and fresh vegetables.",
  "description": "Simmer black beans with tomatoes, spices, garlic, and bouillon, then blend part of the mixture for a thick texture. Serve with a fresh, chunky yogurt topping.",
